    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Grudge, a boundless fantasy sandbox MMO that redefines adventure. Whether you\u2019re slaying world bosses, crafting epic gear, or commanding siege armies, every choice carves your path in a vibrant, player-driven world. With a unique blend of MMORPG, survival, and RTS gameplay, Grudge offers endless possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Epic MMORPG Adventures</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on thrilling quests and conquer challenging dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up skills, customize stats, and master intricate skill trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in parties, join guilds, or dominate in PvP arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride majestic mounts, tame loyal pets, and hunt for legendary gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your allegiance among 6 races and 3 warring factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Survival Crafting &amp; Exploration</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources through woodcutting, mining, fishing, and hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade strongholds, from humble camps to sprawling fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook, smelt, and craft gear, consumables, or massive siege weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open-world monuments and scavenge loot\u2014but beware, death means risking it all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u><br>Real-Time Strategy &amp; Warfare</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct armories to train guards, mercenaries, and towering defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build ships, vehicles, and catapults to dominate land and sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead NPC armies and siege enemy strongholds in massive open-world battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances or wage war to claim territory and glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From forging alliances to razing enemy castles, Grudge blends the best of fantasy MMORPGs, survival crafting, and strategic warfare. Auction rare items, store treasures in banks, or research powerful gear to gain the edge. Whether you play solo, with friends, or against the world, your story awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the fight. Build your empire. Become a legend in Grudge.<u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic open-world sandbox with PvE and PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep crafting, building, and resource systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 races, 3 factions, and endless customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons, world bosses, and epic loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siege warfare with player-controlled NPCs and vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates and community-driven development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Wish-list Grudge now and join our Discord to shape the future of this epic MMO! Your adventure begins soon\u2014prepare to forge your destiny.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Grudge, a boundless fantasy sandbox MMO that redefines adventure. Whether you\u2019re slaying world bosses, crafting epic gear, or commanding siege armies, every choice carves your path in a vibrant, player-driven world. With a unique blend of MMORPG, survival, and RTS gameplay, Grudge offers endless possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Epic MMORPG Adventures</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on thrilling quests and conquer challenging dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up skills, customize stats, and master intricate skill trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in parties, join guilds, or dominate in PvP arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride majestic mounts, tame loyal pets, and hunt for legendary gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your allegiance among 6 races and 3 warring factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>Survival Crafting &amp; Exploration</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources through woodcutting, mining, fishing, and hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade strongholds, from humble camps to sprawling fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook, smelt, and craft gear, consumables, or massive siege weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open-world monuments and scavenge loot\u2014but beware, death means risking it all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u><br>Real-Time Strategy &amp; Warfare</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct armories to train guards, mercenaries, and towering defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build ships, vehicles, and catapults to dominate land and sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead NPC armies and siege enemy strongholds in massive open-world battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances or wage war to claim territory and glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From forging alliances to razing enemy castles, Grudge blends the best of fantasy MMORPGs, survival crafting, and strategic warfare. Auction rare items, store treasures in banks, or research powerful gear to gain the edge. Whether you play solo, with friends, or against the world, your story awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the fight. Build your empire. Become a legend in Grudge.<u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic open-world sandbox with PvE and PvP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep crafting, building, and resource systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 races, 3 factions, and endless customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons, world bosses, and epic loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siege warfare with player-controlled NPCs and vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates and community-driven development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Wish-list Grudge now and join our Discord to shape the future of this epic MMO! Your adventure begins soon\u2014prepare to forge your destiny.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Grudge is a thrilling fantasy MMO sandbox where your choices shape a living world. Explore, fight, build, and conquer in an adventure that fuses MMORPG depth, survival crafting, and real-time strategy. Forge your legacy alone or with friends\u2014will you rise as a hero, a warlord, or a legend?",
